            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Usimizire mahe nyumba ya myao. Usimizire mahe mkpwaza myao, wala mtumishiwe mlume au mtumishiwe mchetu, au ngʼombeye, au pundawe, au chitu chochosi aricho nacho jiranio.”",
